  "quiz_markdown": "### Q1. Figured bass 6 below bass indicates:\n\n- A) First inversion triad\n- B) Root position\n- C) Second inversion only\n- D) Silence\n\n**Answer:** A\n\n### Q2. Continuo players realise harmonies from bass + figures.\n\n**Answer:** True",
